1
00:00:00,929 --> 00:00:03,699
(Howard:)Getting Penny to go back out
with him after she dumped him.

2
00:00:03,698 --> 00:00:05,998
(Raj:)Tricking Penny
into getting engaged.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,040
(Howard:)And a few weeks ago,
he almost did a pull-up.

4
00:00:10,305 --> 00:00:13,335
(Leonard:)I think
someone owes me an apology.

5
00:00:13,341 --> 00:00:15,771
(Sheldon:)Well, don't feel bad.

6
00:00:15,777 --> 00:00:17,877
(Sheldon:)I think we've all
been distracted

7
00:00:17,879 --> 00:00:19,609
(Sheldon:)since the girls
entered our lives.

8
00:00:19,614 --> 00:00:21,514
(Howard:)You admit Amy's a distraction?

9
00:00:21,516 --> 00:00:24,016
(Sheldon:)Oh, very much so.
Listen to this.

10
00:00:24,018 --> 00:00:26,148
(Sheldon:)This is from two days ago.

11
00:00:26,154 --> 00:00:28,784
"Hi. Hope you're having
a good day."

12
00:00:28,790 --> 00:00:31,090
(Sheldon:)Who has time
for this constant sexting?

13
00:00:32,060 --> 00:00:35,600
(Leonard:)Well, maybe
we have lost our focus.

14
00:00:35,597 --> 00:00:39,167
(Howard:)It wouldn't kill us to get
together and brainstorm ideas.

15
00:00:39,167 --> 00:00:41,697
(Raj:)Ooh, we could have one
of those retreats.

16
00:00:41,703 --> 00:00:43,173
Like our own science retreat.

17
00:00:43,171 --> 00:00:45,401
(Howard:)My cousin has a cabin
out in the woods.

18
00:00:45,407 --> 00:00:47,807
(Sheldon:)I'm not going to a
cabin in the woods.

19
00:00:47,809 --> 00:00:50,979
(Sheldon:)Did you see the movie
Cabin in the Woods?

20
00:00:50,979 --> 00:00:52,309
(Leonard:)Then we'll go to a hotel.

21
00:00:52,313 --> 00:00:55,513
(Sheldon:)A hotel?
Did you see The Shining?

22
00:00:55,517 --> 00:00:57,347
KOOTHRAPPALI:
We could go up

23
00:00:57,352 --> 00:00:59,682
(Raj:)to Big Bear
and get a house on the lake.

24
00:00:59,687 --> 00:01:02,317
(Sheldon:)Did you see
The Lake House?

25
00:01:02,323 --> 00:01:04,723
(Raj:)Nothing bad happens
in The Lake House.

26
00:01:04,726 --> 00:01:07,956
(Sheldon:)Yeah, well, no,
not to them. To me.

27
00:01:07,962 --> 00:01:09,162
(Sheldon:)Time traveling mailbox.

28
00:01:09,164 --> 00:01:10,434
(Sheldon:)The only time that traveled

29
00:01:10,432 --> 00:01:13,102
(Sheldon:)was an hour and half
of my life down the toilet.

30
00:01:13,101 --> 00:01:14,901
(Leonard:)Fine. Then we'll just stay here
and do it.

31
00:01:14,903 --> 00:01:16,573
(Sheldon:)Well, you didn't suggest
a beach house.

32
00:01:16,571 --> 00:01:18,001
(Leonard:)You would go to a beach house?

33
00:01:18,006 --> 00:01:20,136
(Sheldon:)Well, good Lord, no--
have you seen Jaws?

34
00:01:21,776 --> 00:01:25,376
♪ Our whole universe
was in a hot, dense state ♪

